WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:15.480
Sara went for a walk.

2
00:00:15.481 --> 00:00:18.552
"Mommy!" someone cried.

3
00:00:18.553 --> 00:00:21.988
"Where are you?"

4
00:00:21.989 --> 00:00:24.961
"Uh-oh," Sara thought.

5
00:00:24.962 --> 00:00:32.007
"That sounds like a young dinosaur."

6
00:00:32.008 --> 00:00:38.166
Sara found the small dinosaur.

7
00:00:38.167 --> 00:00:43.684
He looked scared.

8
00:00:43.685 --> 00:00:47.315
"What's your name?" Sara asked.

9
00:00:47.316 --> 00:00:54.021
The dinosaur sniffed. "I'm Sam.

10
00:00:54.022 --> 00:00:59.704
I want my mommy."

11
00:00:59.705 --> 00:01:03.869
"I'll help you find her," Sara said.

12
00:01:03.870 --> 00:01:09.912
Sam smiled.

13
00:01:09.913 --> 00:01:21.887
Sara and Sam walked.

14
00:01:21.888 --> 00:01:25.246
Sam threw small rocks.

15
00:01:25.247 --> 00:01:27.881
One rock hit a branch.

16
00:01:27.882 --> 00:01:32.767
Tweet! A bird flew away.

17
00:01:32.768 --> 00:01:36.586
"Don't throw rocks, Sam," Sara said.

18
00:01:36.587 --> 00:01:41.482
"You might hurt someone."

19
00:01:41.483 --> 00:01:45.045
Sam threw another rock.

20
00:01:45.046 --> 00:01:49.735
Squeak! A rodent ran away.

21
00:01:49.736 --> 00:01:59.331
"Sam, please stop," Sara said.

22
00:01:59.332 --> 00:02:01.987
Sam threw a rock into a pond.

23
00:02:01.988 --> 00:02:10.474
Splash! Fish swam away.

24
00:02:10.475 --> 00:02:14.317
"Stop that, Sam," Sara said.

25
00:02:14.318 --> 00:02:17.478
"It's not—ouch!"

26
00:02:17.479 --> 00:02:22.598
Sara rubbed her head.

27
00:02:22.599 --> 00:02:28.212
"You threw a rock at me!"

